Modifications and enhancements
------------------------------

Modified and maintained by Kiet Duong (2026). Key changes include a DaVinci
Resolve marker workflow: named in/out ranges can be represented in sidecar
files and imported into Resolve as Media Pool duration markers, without
modifying the original source media. The workflow protects camera proxies in
directories named "Proxy".

